# Safety guardrail for rosandigit/ledsone-aios (a PUBLIC repository).
#
# Purpose: prevent accidental commits of credentials, environment files,
# Amazon/PPC exports and commercially sensitive files.
# Sources: CLAUDE.md Section 9 (secrets and credentials) and
# Section 10 / SD-4 (no Amazon exports or commercially sensitive data).
#
# This file is a guardrail, not a guarantee. It does not stop `git add -f`,
# and it does not affect files that are already tracked. The pre-commit review
# in CLAUDE.md Section 11 still applies to every commit.

# --- Credentials and secrets (CLAUDE.md Section 9) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*credential*
*credentials*
*secret*
*secrets*
*token*
*.token
*password*
*apikey*
*api_key*
*api-key*

# --- Amazon / PPC exports and spreadsheets (SD-4) ---
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.ods
*.numbers

# --- Documents and archives that may hold exports or sensitive data (SD-4) ---
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.gz
*.tar
